(7593462, 1224883, 86447, '<td valign="top">7 from me.     I love everything except the word "cup" on the cup.   In my opinion, it should have been turned to not show it.   Everything else is wonderful, but it would have been an 8 from me without it.</td>', '7 from me.     I love everything except the word "cup" on the cup.   In my opinion, it should have been turned to not show it.   Everything else is wonderful, but it would have been an 8 from me without it.', '2018-08-22 18:08:57.000000', NULL, 1),
