(7593465, 1224898, 86447, '<td valign="top">7 from me.</td>', '7 from me.', '2018-08-22 18:09:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(7593492, 1224786, 87808, '<td valign="top">Well, this is going to get some comments, I am pretty sure <img alt="'' . substr(''https://www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', strrpos(''https://www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="https://www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif"/> <a href="https://www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=86447" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Lydia</a> will say something about smoking!  Myself though, I like it, your face is perfection when it comes to sharpness and clarity, every whisker is tack! One thing though, is in the smoke, if you do a neutral colour selection and then play a little with the blues and whites, you will find that you get some amazing contrasts, blues and contrasting whites.  I found this out on a smoke photo I did. You can make a difference too with a little dodge and burn, make that big cloud not so one dimensional. I really like your photo, well done!  Vote later</td>', 'Well, this is going to get some comments, I am pretty sure  Lydia will say something about smoking!  Myself though, I like it, your face is perfection when it comes to sharpness and clarity, every whisker is tack! One thing though, is in the smoke, if you do a neutral colour selection and then play a little with the blues and whites, you will find that you get some amazing contrasts, blues and contrasting whites.  I found this out on a smoke photo I did. You can make a difference too with a little dodge and burn, make that big cloud not so one dimensional. I really like your photo, well done!  Vote later', '2018-08-23 01:37:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(7593494, 1224902, 87808, '<td valign="top">I see where you are going with this. It is good, but for me, maybe, one tiny spot on the ciggie cherry or smoke (only a tiny bit mind) would have made this more impactful It is a great shot though.</td>', 'I see where you are going with this. It is good, but for me, maybe, one tiny spot on the ciggie cherry or smoke (only a tiny bit mind) would have made this more impactful It is a great shot though.', '2018-08-23 01:50:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(7593496, 1224897, 87808, '<td valign="top">You are right, It kinda looks like a date that you get for Christmas in a tray, from relatives that hate you. If it is meant to be a pot pipe, then maybe you should try a date.</td>', 'You are right, It kinda looks like a date that you get for Christmas in a tray, from relatives that hate you. If it is meant to be a pot pipe, then maybe you should try a date.', '2018-08-23 02:02:13.000000', NULL, 1),
